# IMP-11 (D-D2, AC-D; SR-005 N-3) a stopped call read back from the node, per writer: the reproduction, then the fix
# command: cd autobyteus-server-ts && pnpm exec vitest run --reporter=verbose tests/unit/run-history/projection/stopped-tool-call-read-back.test.ts
#          (first with raw-trace-to-historical-replay-events.ts and historical-replay-events-to-conversation.ts from the
#          branch head 8ea2261a6a, the files restored after; then on the fix) ;
#          pnpm exec vitest run --reporter=verbose tests/unit/agent-memory/tool-result-interruption.test.ts
# commit: head 8ea2261a6a's two replay files + the new test (reproduction); 70f3d8d410 (fix)
# env: macOS arm64, Node v22.23.1
# date: 2026-11-23
# result: Reproduced, then fixed. At the head every writer's stopped call reads back "error" in the activity and on the
#         earlier-trace page, and the conversation entry carries no status (5 of 5 fail). With D-D2 all 5 pass.
#
# The test drives the real writers into a run memory folder and reads it back through LocalMemoryRunViewProjectionProvider
# (every runtime's history), checking the conversation entry's toolStatus, the activity's status and the page card's
# statusKey:
#   - Codex: real-shaped app-server notifications through the Codex thread converter, the segment lifecycle and the
#     node's runtime memory accumulator; a command still running at `turn/completed` status "interrupted" (shape of the
#     recorded fixture codex-interrupt-manual) is written by the sequencer with sourceEvent TURN_INTERRUPTED. A command
#     that failed in the same turn stays "error".
#   - a runtime reporting TOOL_EXECUTION_INTERRUPTED (Claude, Antigravity) through the accumulator; a failed call stays "error".
#   - native AutoByteus: the real MemoryManager.finalizePendingToolCallsForTurn (reasons user_interrupt and another);
#     a failed native call stays "error".
#   - a stored result with only the interruption's error text; a denial (TOOL_DENIED with provider_state ERROR, even with
#     error user_interrupt) stays "denied".

